Repository API-Sheriff (Java 25, Quarkus gateway). ClientJwksEndpoint serves the public JWKS of the BFF's client-authentication key (private_key_jwt) at an unauthenticated path, so the identity provider can verify the client assertions the BFF signs. The key may be an RSA, EC or symmetric key. Logging goes through CuiLogger; DEBUG may be enabled in production for diagnosis.

